@segment   tuning-hum
@title     The Tuning Hum
@levels    F21, F22, F23, F24, F25, F26, F27, F34, F35, F42, F49
@duration  ~1m30s

say Breathe with the waves once more.
pause 4
say This time, let the hum drop back down, quiet. Quieter than you'd expect. Quiet enough that you'd barely be heard, but loud enough that you can't miss it.
pause 5
say At this volume, you'll feel it more than hear it. In your skull. Your jaw. The space behind your eyes.
hold 60
say Let the hum settle. Let your breath return to its own quiet rhythm.
pause 6
